From b298aafcb31ddd59c300ce83eb698150f65de0ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ji Mao Cai <44921326+jinghero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:11:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] windows: recover temporary VM images owned by the same AVD

Reserve the temporary hardware INI, read-only drive overlays, and both halves of a temporary cache before handing their paths to QEMU. Pin the files for the session and record the AVD and file identities at exclusive creation. Recover a crashed session only after validating its receipt and obtaining exclusive access to the original file.

Write the private INI in place to keep its reserved identity. Leave legacy temporary files and unproven ownership alone.
